 "limitations": [
  "Layer groups are containers and are not counted in the cap of 10; the 10 counted elements are 9 components and 1 datastore.",
  "The UserFactory interface (two implementations), the entities User/Student/Librarian, UserDTO and RestExceptionHandler were read but are not drawn: the viewpoint has no generalization relation and no entity kind, and no claims were recorded for them.",
  "The browser client (registration.html) calls POST /api/auth/register but has no code symbol, so it is not an element.",
  "JpaUtil reaches the database only through persistence unit reservationsPU (persistence.xml); the reads/writes edges are drawn from PersistenceManager with persistence.xml as second citation.",
  "The relation direction UserManager -> factories is by instantiation; UserRegistry is placed in the domain layer because its package is entity."
